 "guideline": "Customer reply: negative about the answer -> rejection, positive -> approval (both grade the reply it answers), a question -> none. reopened -> rework (grades the resolving status change). Reassignment to another team -> escalation (grades the last answer given before it, none if there was none). refund_reversed -> revert (grades the refund). supervisor_edit -> correction (grades the reply it edits). policy_flag -> violation (grades the event that wrote the flagged object). supervisor_approval -> approval (same). sla_breach -> sla_breach (grades the assignment). csat -> outcome (trace level). Everything else -> none. Outcome: CSAT <= 2, or reopened without a later resolution -> bad; resolved with CSAT >= 4 or no CSAT -> good; CSAT 3 -> unknown.",
